{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 2,\n      \"wrong\": \"把原文的“这回没急着拿受过的气压住这份想念”拼成了“努力压住想念”，恰好把这一屏重要的心理变化说反了。原文是开始允许自己想念过去，而不是继续压抑想念。靠自己挺过去则是正确拼出的内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把原文尚未分清的两种可能性收窄成了一个确定原因。完整稿是在问：究竟是舍不得被当作自己人的日子，还是害怕孤单到愿意重新忍受那些委屈。观众把它拼成了因为太留恋过去，所以委屈也变得可以忍受，丢失了对自身动机的困惑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了当初那些让他难受的事情不能当作没发生过这一关键原因。原文不仅是无法确定回去后能否恢复亲近，更是知道过去的伤害仍然存在，因此不能仅凭舍不得就放心回去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了一个重要的结局条件：即使将来一直没有遇到愿意把他当作自己人的人，他也愿意独自好好生活。观众主要拼出了等待、珍惜亲近关系和不再牺牲自己，却没有完整拼出不依赖未来关系也能好好生活的态度。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿基本是同一件事：一个人因不愿继续受委屈而离开熟悉亲近的生活，却在孤独中反复怀念、动摇，最终接受想念与离开可以并存，不再责怪自己，也不再为留住关系牺牲自己，重新获得向前生活的力量。虽然遗漏了即使没有重新获得亲近也愿意独自生活的结尾细节，但没有改变全曲的核心故事和情感走向。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "396e5474-498f-4b75-85c8-8fb4a204a244", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023749036057Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:38:33.912861+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1a442797d80b9a377032308475ad747ca663ffaff478025b9f2fcf72a260a1e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023749036057Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4519dac7321dd46e65c417ef52e3771e3cc3d729888df20c947c8ff69e6a4618"}}}
